%% Checkout flow
flowchart LR
  start([Start]) --> cart[View cart]
  cart --> pay{Pay now?}
  pay -->|yes| card[(Card vault)]
  pay -- later --> save[Save cart]
  card & save --> done([Done])
  save -.-> cart
  subgraph backend [Backend]
    card
    audit((Audit))
  end
  card --- audit
  classDef hot fill:#f96
  class pay hot
  click pay "https://example.com"
